+-    CreateFileW, FindFirstStreamW, FindNextStreamW, GetDiskFreeSpaceExW, GetLogicalDriveStringsW,
+-    GetVolumeInformationW, ReadFile, SetFilePointerEx, FILE_ATTRIBUTE_NORMAL,
